  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water Sector Investment Program PFR4</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed Project 4 to Hanoi Water Company Limited (HAWACOM) will improve water services for 3 million people, and provide piped water connections for 740,000 people for the first time, including about 23,000 poor. The Ministry of Planning and Investment is the coordinating agency for the MFF. HAWACOM is the project owner and implementing agency for Project 4, while the executing agency is the Ha Noi Peoples Committee.</narrative>
  </description>
